---
import { CATEGORY_DEFINITIONS, SITE, categoryPath } from '../config/site';
import { buildContactUrl } from '../lib/tracking';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer" data-pagefind-ignore="all">
  <div class="container site-footer__grid">
    <div class="site-footer__brand">
      <a href={SITE.homeUrl} class="site-footer__brand-link">
        <img src={SITE.logoPath} width="48" height="48" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <span>
          <strong>CORE COMPANY</strong>
          <small>On-Premise AI, Rooted in Space.</small>
        </span>
      </a>
      <p>현장의 문제를 먼저 살피고, 필요한 기술의 범위와 운영 기준을 함께 정리합니다.</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="site-footer__nav" aria-label="블로그 카테고리">
      <h2>블로그 카테고리</h2>
      <ul>
        {CATEGORY_DEFINITIONS.map((category) => (
          <li><a href={categoryPath(category.name)}>{category.name}</a></li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <nav class="site-footer__nav" aria-label="Core Company 관련 링크">
      <h2>Core Company</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={SITE.homeUrl}>공식 홈페이지</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${SITE.basePath}/editorial-policy/`}>저자·편집 원칙</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${SITE.basePath}/search/`}>블로그 검색</a></li>
        <li><a href={SITE.privacyUrl}>개인정보처리방침</a></li>
        <li>
          <a href={SITE.naverBlogUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            네이버 블로그 <span class="visually-hidden">(새 창)</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href={buildContactUrl({ cta: 'footer' })}
            data-analytics-event="contact_cta_click"
            data-analytics-cta="footer"
            data-testid="contact-cta"
            data-cta-position="footer"
          >
            도입 문의
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="container site-footer__legal">
    <p>© {year} Core Company. All rights reserved.</p>
    <p>CORE COMPANY EDITORIAL / PRACTICAL &amp; VERIFIED</p>
  </div>
</footer>
